the employer's shear table (per the patient; the employer's incident record is
their own). Exam and imaging
([imaging/hand-xray-pa.jpg](imaging/hand-xray-pa.jpg),
[hand-xray-lat.jpg](imaging/hand-xray-lat.jpg) — see
[hand-xray-pa.mdy](imaging/hand-xray-pa.mdy)):
[4 cm dorsal laceration, no tendon involvement, no radiopaque foreign body](#assessment).

